# Spatial ROI Model

Framework for quantifying the business impact of location intelligence.

## Use Cases

### Retail
- Site selection optimization
- Foot traffic + trade area analysis
- Revenue lift from better location decisions

### Insurance
- Risk modeling based on geography
- Climate + catastrophe exposure analysis
- Improved underwriting accuracy

### Telecom
- Network planning and expansion
- Coverage gap identification
- Capex optimization

## What This Enables
- Ties spatial analytics directly to revenue and cost savings
- Supports enterprise deal justification
- Bridges data teams → executive buyers

## Why It Matters
Location data is often underutilized.  
This model translates it into measurable business outcomes.
